 lus a 20% discount on workshops\; there is also a volunteer option. Deadli
 ne to submit a proposal is 16 August 2026. Enquiries: subscriptions@livepe
 rformersmeeting.net.\n\nOrganisation: LPM - Live Performers Meeting\nLocat
 ion: Rome\, Italy\nAward: Paid open call\, not a grant: participation requ
 ires an artist/guest subscription of EUR 20 (includes a pass for all activ
 ities\, a T-shirt\, a daily drink\, and a 30-minute performance slot)\, pl
 us 20% off workshops. The Live Immersive Contest offers prizes from techni
 cal partners.\nDuration: Festival edition in Rome 2026\n\nMore: https://li
 veperformersmeeting.net/editions/2026-rome/call-to-participate/?utm_source
