 project-award/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Republic of Ireland. Applicants based outside Ireland may apply if
  the application clearly shows how outcomes benefit the arts in the Republ
 ic of Ireland.
